functions.docstring:
Flag months where Aqua data are missing/partial (e.g. ~Aug-2020, ~Apr-2022).
(a) overlap: Aqua fire-days / SNPP fire-days well below the usual ratio for that calendar month;
(b) overlap: robust LOW outlier of log(Aqua/predicted) per calendar month, with reduced coverage;
(c) pre-VIIRS: Aqua days far below the calendar-month median (no VIIRS to cross-check).
